        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Panel and strip from a Kimono of red silk-crepe, embroidered with coloured silks and gold thread, the pattern is partly produced by tied and dye work (<i>shibori</i>). The pattern consists of pine and bamboo foliage, rockery, fishing-boats afloat on the water, and fishing nets hung up to dry."@en ;
